      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Gothic remake is a well made game in terms of respect for the original installment although it's not intended to be a 1:1 remake. There's some new addition that make the original story a bit longer.\n\n\n\nFor anyone interested in a fantasy rpg with a medieval setting this is a buy."
