      "user": "gamer-2840b91",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "**DO NOT BUY — REGION-LOCKED KEY**\n\n\n\nBought a Steam key from this seller, only to find out that the key **cannot be activated in my country**. Steam immediately rejected the activation and cancelled the purchase.\n\n\n\nThe product was presented as a Steam key, but the regional restriction was either not clearly disclosed or was easy to miss. Now I'm stuck having to deal with a key I cannot use.\n\n\n\n**Check the activation region very carefully before buying from this seller.** I would not recommend purchasing unless you are 100% certain the key works in your country."
    },
